{"id":"n28347-1-10","stage":3,"title":"다방 · 茶馆","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28347-1-10-1","ko":"엄마와 아빠는 젊으셨을 때 주로 어디에서 데이트를 하셨어요?","zh":"妈妈和爸爸年轻的时候，主要在哪儿约会呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마와","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마와","audio":"/audio/f6f1c7ae95622b051ca4.mp3"}},{"text":"아빠는","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠는","audio":"/audio/d2e45bcc2f45bf3de8f7.mp3"}},{"text":"젊으셨을","meaning":"年青，年轻","explanation":"젊다：年青，年轻；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"젊다","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75773","senseId":"1","lemma":"젊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젊으셨을","audio":"/audio/b4311a4a7fb2efe568d9.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"주로","meaning":"主要","explanation":"주로：主要。","readings":[{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91767","senseId":"1","lemma":"주로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","s